-- ============================================================================
--  MIRIFER — Days 101-120: the final twenty
--
--  The landing page has always advertised 120 days and the course stopped at
--  100. This closes that gap.
--
--  These are the last lessons in the path, so they are deliberately the
--  hardest: 13-15 sentences each (the B1 band in curriculum.ts), longer turns,
--  and grammar that has not appeared before — Konjunktiv II across whole
--  arguments, Passiv, relative clauses, indirect speech, Genitiv, and the
--  two-part connectors that make German sound like an adult wrote it.
--
--  The scenes are chosen for the audience rather than for a textbook: a job
--  interview, the Bürgeramt, a rental contract, a salary negotiation, a
--  disagreement with a neighbour. These are the situations that decide how
--  someone's life in Germany actually goes.
--
--  Run once in the Supabase SQL editor. Safe to re-run: each day is deleted
--  before it is re-inserted, and sentences cascade.
-- ============================================================================

BEGIN;

-- Idempotent: drop these twenty days first so a re-run replaces rather than
-- duplicates. ON DELETE CASCADE removes their sentences with them.
DELETE FROM public.lessons WHERE day BETWEEN 101 AND 120;

